 "description": "Returns the upcoming matches of one league, earliest first: kick-off date and time, teams, a match slug, and the model's calibrated probabilities (home and away win, over/under goal lines, both teams to score, half-time lines; the draw probability is 1 - home - away) with team attack and defence ratings. The probabilities come from a baseline statistical model of past results (no injuries, motivation or weather) and are not bookmaker prices.",
